{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And he saw the Kenite.</b> This is Ammon; he is the Kenite mentioned in the perasha of the covenant between the pieces: את הקיני ואת הקניזי ואת הקדמוני — these are Ammon, Moab, and Edom. He already prophesied concerning Moab and Edom about the future, and now he prophesies concerning Ammon." "<b>Your dwelling is strong, etc.</b> You prophesy concerning what the Holy One, blessed be He, said to Israel: Do not besiege them, etc. By your life, this will avail you nothing in the future." "<b>And set.</b> It is a noun. He explained: שימת בסלע קנך — castrate it (read it unpointed); שימת קינך בסלע — it is."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:36.054075261Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}